: A legacy (protocol v1) thread whose original conversation was rich —
: reasoning, a sub-agent, chart artifacts. v1 cannot express most of that:
: thinking disappears, the sub-agent's work arrives flattened as plain tool
: calls, artifacts ride inline. How the console degrades here is the point.

